{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00735","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享章怀太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享章怀太子庙乐章 迎俎酌献","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"通三锡胤，明两承英。\n太山比赫，伊水闻笙。\n宗祧是寄，礼乐其亨。\n嘉辰荐俎，以发声明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00735.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00735","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}